## 🎯 What I Learned

- Learned how HTML forms collect user input.
- Used different input types for different kinds of data.
- Learned the difference between radio buttons and checkboxes.
- Created dropdown lists using `<select>` and `<option>`.
- Used `<textarea>` for multi-line input.
- Connected labels and inputs using `for` and `id`.
- Used `required` to make form fields mandatory.
- Used `placeholder` to provide hints to users.
- Learned the basic purpose of `action` and `method`.

